        <h2 class="font-weight-light">About VANMATE</h2>
<p class="fst-italic text-muted mb-4">VanMate is a dynamic web application for school-going kids provides a solution
for parents who are looking for a safe, reliable, and convenient way to transport
their children to and from school. The offers an easy-to-use platform for
booking and scheduling private van rides, as well as real-time tracking and
automated notifications to keep parents informed about their children’s
whereabouts. The ensures the safety of children by providing information
about the van fleet, driver qualifications, and safety standards.
</p>
      </div>
</div>
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-5 px-5 mx-auto"><img src="/Van_Mate/images/parents.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid mb-4 mb-lg-0"></div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <h2 class="font-weight-light">VANMATE Benefits</h2>
        <p class="font-italic text-muted mb-4">Parents or schools can easily book and schedule van rides through the website, with options to choose from multiple routes, pick-up/drop-off locations, and dates/times.
Parents and schools can access information about the drivers, including their qualifications, certifications, and driving records, to ensure the safety of their children. Parents and schools can track the location of the van in real-time, ensuring that their children are safe and on-schedule.
Online payment option will also be available for advance payment or payment.Feedback and review facility is available for parent and school regarding drivers. Messages/Notifications can also send to school/parent regarding the status of Van like late arrival, cancellation etc.
.</p>
      </div>
